  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">National Innovation and Startup Policy</h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n<strong>Organizing Department Name: Institutions Innovation Council (IIC)</strong>\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Title of the event: </strong>National Innovation and Startup Policy\n\n<strong>Date: 04-01-2021</strong>\n\n<strong>Venue: Through MS Teams</strong>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Event Description: </strong>ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a webinar on the topic “National Innovation and Startup Policy” in association with Institutions Innovation Council on 4<sup>th</sup> January 2021. Mr. Sandeep Patil, Executive Director, Applied Cognition Systems Pvt Ltd disseminated the information of National Innovation and Startup Policy – 2019 among the students and faculties of the Institution.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
